$\n\n- Statement $Pq=q$ is false. Note that\n\n$$\nPq=\\begin{bmatrix}0.25 & 0.3 & 0.5 \\\\ 0.15 & 0.3 & 0.2 \\\\ 0.6 & 0.4 & 0.3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{9} \\\\ \\frac{4}{9} \\\\ \\frac{1}{9}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{9}+\\frac{1.2}{9}+\\frac{0.5}{9} \\\\ \\frac{0.6}{9}+\\frac{1.2}{9}+\\frac{0.2}{9} \\\\ \\frac{2.4}{9}+\\frac{1.6}{9}+\\frac{0.3}{9}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2.7}{9} \\\\ \\frac{2}{9} \\\\ \\frac{4.3}{9}\\end{bmatrix}\\ne q.\n$$\n\n- Statement “$q$ is a steady-state vector of $P$” is false. Since $Pq\\ne q,$ it is not a steady-state vector of $P.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “$q$ is a stochastic vector” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269027 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124615 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f4f2f4f4-af4a-597d-b6c6-afb82e708fc2" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Steady-State Vectors of Stochastic Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5bb71a5f-f73d-5fac-a904-0ec46d003a34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464042} {:answer/id #uuid "925571bf-524a-5b26-a71c-08fcdbb6cf5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464043}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "925571bf-524a-5b26-a71c-08fcdbb6cf5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464043} :answer-field/id #uuid "db8add19-aac6-59b9-bd74-3fc72979db70" :answer-field/key "$q$ is a stochastic vector" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464955} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70275795-38dd-5185-a8e8-361217a98984" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464044} {:answer/id