0} :answer-field/id #uuid "0ab468c6-4c77-52a0-871b-2e05cd810382" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668822}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e16f6fa7-ae80-51bb-bdf3-1add916dcb13" :question/math-academy-id "q-178269" :question/problem "$$\n{u}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{u}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nConsider the vectors above, and let $Q$ be an orthogonal linear transformation. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Since $Q$ is orthogonal, we have that $Q(x)\\cdot Q(y)=x\\cdot y$ for any vectors $x$ and $y.$\n\nThe linear transformation $Q$ being orthogonal is equivalent to the following:\n\n- The matrix $Q$ of transformation $Q$ relative to any orthonormal basis (including the standard basis) of ${R}^{n}$ is orthogonal.\n\n- $||Q(x)||=||x||.$\n\n- If $x⊥y$ then $Q(x)⊥Q(y)$ for any $x,y\\in {R}^{n}.$ In general, $Q$ preserves the angle between any two vectors.\n\n- $Q$ maps any orthogonal (orthonormal) set into an orthogonal (orthonormal) set.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements.\n\n- Statement ${u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{2}=0$ is false. Indeed,\n\n$$\n{u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}=6+3\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- Statement “$\\{Q({u}_{1}),Q({u}_{2})\\}$ is orthogonal” is false. Notice that, $Q({u}_{1})⊥̸Q({u}_{2})$ since\n\n$$\nQ({u}_{1})\\cdot Q({u}_{2})={u}_{1}\\cdot {u}_{2}\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n- Statement “$\\{Q({u}_{1}),Q({u}_{2})\\}$ is orthonormal” is false since the set is not even orthogonal.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of the statements are true.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287773 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054636 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3fca5176-1359-5ad8-b012-592ffa9b20b5" :knowledge-point/title "Cartesian Products With Three Sets"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a80f9fc-05fe-5ace-b2b6-c9c7320d81f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465779} {:answer/id #uuid "29c462c5-d4bc-5565-a927-664efcdedf61" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465780}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "29c462c5-d4bc-5565-a927-664efcdedf61" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465780} :answer-field/id #uuid "7bcbd138-2a90-5573-a003-398f39e996b4" :answer-field/key "$(p,q,2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186466733} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dedafa18-c178-5144-b2cf-bd1660e73fc5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465781} {:answer/id #uuid "256ce2be-5e83-5d17-8444-669f0ac7b071" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465782}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dedafa18-c178-5144-b2cf-bd1660e73fc5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465781} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b66c993-3c63-5268-96e7-ba6ab6e2950f" :answer-field/key "$((p,p),4)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186466734} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7c3f222f-bcfc-59e8-8d46-f8ac30ebaba8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465783} {:answer/id #uuid "b23ff7fa-46dc-5325-a30b-23369fa2d4ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465784}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b23ff7fa-46dc-5325-a30b-23369fa2d4ac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465784} :answer-field/id #uuid "3082fdb7-2d3c-5ad6-8f45-54d8562f9917" :answer-field/key "$(q,q,6)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186466735} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e1e9f156-de35-5b68-9135-60269250246a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668491} {:answer/id #uuid "ab82028f-d9e4-52be-ba8b-60f63315c816" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668492}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e1e9f156-de35-5b68-9135-60269250246a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668491} :answer-field/id #uuid "3bab36f4-381b-5cf4-b141-b500b204dd52" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668823}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "68270c3d-bf20-5dbc-8e60-99dca2522513" :question/math-academy-id "q-181947" :question/problem "If $A=\\{p,q\\}$ and $B=\\{2,4,6\\},$ which of the following elements belong to $A\\times A\\times B?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The Cartesian product $A\\times B\\times C$ consists of all ordered triples whose first coordinate belongs to $A,$ second coordinate belongs to $B,$ and the third coordinate belongs to $C.$\n\nIn this case, $A\\times A\\times B$ consists of every combination of $\\{p,q\\}$ with $\\{p,q\\}$ and $\\{2,4,6\\},$ which results in\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A\\times A\\times B=\\{ & (p,p,2),(p,p,4),(p,p,6),(p,q,2),(p,q,4),(p,q,6), \\\\  & (q,p,2),(q,p,4),(q,p,6),(q,q,2),(q,q,4),(q,q,6)\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that\n\n$$\n|A\\times A\\times B|=|A|\\cdot |A|\\cdot |B|=2\\cdot 2\\cdot 3=12.\n$$\n\nFrom the given options, we see that both $(p,q,2)$ and $(q,q,6)$ are in $A\\times A\\times B.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $(p,q,2)$; $(q,q,6)$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287789 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054634 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6128eca-7f76-5386-9d67-d81db2943eeb" :knowledge-point/title "Computing a Cartesian Product"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9f93b4b3-45d3-55bc-83c9-c5f237b38683" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465815} {:answer/id #uuid "e948852e-a109-5081-8701-a5fabda5db26" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465816}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9f93b4b3-45d3-55bc-83c9-c5f237b38683" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465815} :answer-field/id #uuid "92f664e0-0d84-5e1b-8c56-90f911282aed" :answer-field/key "$(a,x)\\in Z$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186466751} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00c07d2a-5301-5cda-afaa-d397be215d7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465817} {:answer/id #uuid "6e08ffdd-8ad6-5fca-9876-1ba9a4cbe9c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465818}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e08ffdd-8ad